WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.920
YASREF is changing

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.380
its SALARY CYCLE

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.409
to align with best practice,

00:00:05.429 --> 00:00:08.410
and make it more timely and relevant

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.169
Only the TIMING changes:

00:00:11.189 --> 00:00:14.441
when your benefits are received

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.829
Your benefits and Total Reward Package

00:00:17.849 --> 00:00:20.061
stay exactly the same

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.278
Today, our cycle runs

00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:24.380
from JANUARY to DECEMBER

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.195
One cycle.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.475
In NOVEMBER, two things

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.090
happen in parallel

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.077
MERIT & SALARY MOVEMENT,

00:00:32.097 --> 00:00:34.405
based on next year's expected

00:00:34.425 --> 00:00:36.630
inflation and market trends

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.964
and the YEAR-END ESTIMATE

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.907
Finalized in DECEMBER,

00:00:41.927 --> 00:00:44.701
reflected in JANUARY

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:46.563
Now, here's the

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.440
NEW PROPOSED CYCLE

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.357
From FEBRUARY, decisions rely on

00:00:55.377 --> 00:00:58.280
ACTUAL results, not estimates

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.534
In MARCH,

00:01:00.554 --> 00:01:03.124
YIB & bonus are paid

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.561
And in APRIL, merit increases and

00:01:06.581 --> 00:01:09.620
promotion adjustments are reflected

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:13.497
This transition applies to the

00:01:13.517 --> 00:01:16.690
2026 IMPLEMENTATION YEAR ONLY

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.838
The percentage doesn't change -

00:01:22.858 --> 00:01:25.290
only the months it covers

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.226
The same transition applies

00:01:28.246 --> 00:01:30.240
to your LEAVE BALANCE

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.179
From APRIL 2027,

00:01:34.199 --> 00:01:37.398
a new annual balance begins

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.673
For further clarification,

00:01:40.693 --> 00:01:42.899
contact HR personnel.
